{"id":54976,"date":"2026-07-23T23:46:42","date_gmt":"2026-07-23T22:46:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=54976"},"modified":"2026-09-03T00:29:30","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T23:29:30","slug":"maratona-de-roterdao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-roterdao\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Roterd\u00e3o 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Roterd\u00e3o 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Roterd\u00e3o 2027<\/strong> (NN Marathon Rotterdam) \u00e9 mundialmente famosa como o templo dos recordes e uma das provas mais r\u00e1pidas do planeta, realizada na moderna cidade portu\u00e1ria de <strong>Roterd\u00e3o<\/strong>, nos <strong>Pa\u00edses Baixos<\/strong>. Com partida junto \u00e0 imponente <strong>Ponte Erasmus (Erasmusbrug)<\/strong> e chegada triunfal na avenida <strong>Coolsingel<\/strong> perante quase 1 milh\u00e3o de espetadores, a prova \u00e9 uma lenda viva do atletismo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com selo World Athletics Gold Label, o evento re\u00fane a elite mundial e mais de 45.000 corredores em v\u00e1rias dist\u00e2ncias: a <strong>Maratona (42,195 km)<\/strong>, a <strong>1\/4 Maratona (10,55 km)<\/strong> e a <strong>City Run (4,2 km)<\/strong>. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o exemplar da <strong>Golazo Sports<\/strong> proporciona abastecimentos rigorosos a cada 5 km, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, medalha comemorativa de prest\u00edgio e uma atmosfera festiva indescrit\u00edvel ao som de m\u00fasica ao vivo por toda a cidade.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">11 de Abril de 2027 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4p